  <comment>Generate browser SSO Session handling, authenticated GET /connect/userinfo, and anonymous GET /connect/logout. Issue only an opaque protected host-only cookie containing no identity, token, Scope, or provider-secret data; configure HttpOnly, environment-sensitive Secure, SameSite=Lax, and the Authority Protocol SSO lifetime. Resolve the cookie to the server-side SSO Session and reject missing, expired, revoked, or non-Active User sessions. Project sub, name, email, optional picture, Principal Type, and configured contextual claims. Logout revokes only the current SSO Session, clears the cookie, never implicitly revokes Access Tokens, and redirects only to an exact registered Post-Logout Redirect URI for the supplied active OAuth Client, otherwise /. </comment>
